WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.600
Hey team psychology, welcome to day
one of Introduction to Psychology.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.210
Let's take 90 seconds and walk
through how this class actually works.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.150
Consider this your syllabus tour.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:16.520
We meet Mondays and Wednesdays, 8 to 9:15,

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.320
in VAAS 309.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.510
Attendance drives this class.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:24.360
A big share of your grade
happens in the room,

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:28.100
and in-class work can't be
made up if you're absent.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.550
Your textbook is free:

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.840
OpenStax Psychology, right in Canvas.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:33.970
No late work.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:37.360
If life happens, message
me before the due date,

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.170
not after.

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:41.200
The Canvas inbox is the
fastest way to reach me;

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.280
I answer within 24 hours.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.330
Tonight's job:

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:47.870
the first-day check-in
assignment in Canvas,

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:50.360
due by 11:59 tonight.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.440
It's how I know you're really here.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.650
Skip it and you can be
dropped from the class.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:58.480
And here's what makes
this class different:

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.190
AI isn't banned.

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:02.070
It's encouraged, the right way.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:03.700
That's the DIVER method:

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:07.080
Discovery, Interaction,
Verification, Editing,

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.040
Reflection.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:11.310
Use AI to dive deeper, never
to float on the surface.

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:14.150
You've also got Siggy,
my AI teaching assistant,

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:18.160
free and awake at 2 a.m., in the
Siggy module at the top of the course.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:21.800
Your first quiz covers all
of this, due Friday night,

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.760
open syllabus.

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:24.200
That's the tour.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:25.500
Let's dive in.
